  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_01",
      "hash64": "2C21F0A1DF8E081B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], tu tombes bien !\\nVeux-tu bien faire le guet avec moi ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_02",
      "hash64": "2C21F1A1DF8E09CE",
      "text": "Je vais tendre une embuscade à l’étudiante\\nqui m’observe depuis tout ce temps ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "9D49A5E8910AAAE2",
      "text": "Lui tendre une embuscade ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "9D49A4E8910AA92F",
      "text": "Mais pourquoi ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_03",
      "hash64": "2C21F2A1DF8E0B81",
      "text": "Il faut me comprendre. J’en ai assez de sentir\\nce regard pesant sur moi à longueur de temps.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_04",
      "hash64": "2C21F3A1DF8E0D34",
      "text": "Et comme j’ai pu voir son visage à la cafétéria,\\nje compte bien la confronter ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_05",
      "hash64": "2C21F4A1DF8E0EE7",
      "text": "Aaah-ha ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_06",
      "hash64": "2C21F5A1DF8E109A",
      "text": "C’est toi qui passes ton temps à m’observer\\ndernièrement, hein ?! Avoue-le ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_01",
      "hash64": "EB672704C6358444",
      "text": "M-madame Thaïm ?!\\nComment l’avez-vous su... ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_02",
      "hash64": "EB672A04C635895D",
      "text": "Je... je suis désolée...\\nJe ne savais pas que vous m’aviez remarquée...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_07",
      "hash64": "2C21F6A1DF8E124D",
      "text": "Vu le temps que tu y passais, c’était impossible\\nde ne pas le voir, enfin !\\c\\nAlors, parle maintenant. As-tu quelque chose\\nà me demander ?![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_03",
      "hash64": "EB672904C63587AA",
      "text": "Ou-oui...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_04",
      "hash64": "EB672404C6357F2B",
      "text": "À vrai dire, je vous admire depuis l’époque où\\nvous étiez Championne d’Arène ! Et comme vous,\\r\\nj’adore les capacités de type Roche !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_08",
      "hash64": "2C21E7A1DF8DF8D0",
      "text": "Oh...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_05",
      "hash64": "EB672304C6357D78",
      "text": "Cependant, vous avez mis fin à votre carrière\\nil y a un an et demi, et je me demande\\r\\nce qui vous a poussée à le faire.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_09",
      "hash64": "2C21E8A1DF8DFA83",
      "text": "Oh là là !\\nC’était donc aussi simple que ça ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_06",
      "hash64": "EB672604C6358291",
      "text": "C’est que... Nous n’avons jamais officiellement\\nsu pourquoi vous avez quitté votre poste...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_07",
      "hash64": "EB672504C63580DE",
      "text": "Et une rumeur s’était répandue parmi les élèves\\ndisant que vous bottiez en touche si on vous\\r\\ninterrogeait à ce sujet...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_08",
      "hash64": "EB672004C635785F",
      "text": "Je n’ai donc pas osé vous poser une question\\nà laquelle vous ne souhaitiez manifestement pas\\r\\nrépondre. Ça aurait été très impoli de ma part...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_10",
      "hash64": "2C24F5A1DF904671",
      "text": "Voilà d’où te venait ce regard intense... Tu étais\\nsimplement curieuse comme un Poussacha.\\r\\nJe te demande pardon.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_09",
      "hash64": "EB671F04C63576AC",
      "text": "Euh... Vous dites que j’ai l’air d’un Poussacha ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_11",
      "hash64": "2C24F4A1DF9044BE",
      "text": "Hum, bon, revenons à nos Moumouton.\\c\\nJ’ai quitté mon poste de Championne afin de\\nme concentrer sur mon métier d’enseignante.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_12",
      "hash64": "2C24F3A1DF90430B",
      "text": "Tu sais... J’ai adoré occuper cette fonction\\nle temps que ça a duré.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_13",
      "hash64": "2C24F2A1DF904158",
      "text": "Évoquer ces souvenirs me rend nostalgique.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_14",
      "hash64": "2C24F9A1DF904D3D",
      "text": "Voilà pourquoi j’avais tendance à esquiver\\nles questions des élèves à ce sujet...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_10",
      "hash64": "EB63A204C6326C6E",
      "text": "D’accord, je comprends...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_11",
      "hash64": "EB63A304C6326E21",
      "text": "Mais alors, pourquoi ne pas reprendre\\nvos activités de Championne ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_15",
      "hash64": "2C24F8A1DF904B8A",
      "text": "Oh, je n’en ai aucune intention.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_16",
      "hash64": "2C24F7A1DF9049D7",
      "text": "Ma petite sœur a repris le flambeau et fait\\nun excellent travail.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_17",
      "hash64": "2C24F6A1DF904824",
      "text": "Quant à moi, je m’épanouis davantage en tant\\nqu’enseignante.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_18",
      "hash64": "2C24EDA1DF9038D9",
      "text": "Alors, j’espère que tu continueras à m’admirer\\npour mes talents dans une salle de classe plutôt\\r\\nque dans une Arène.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_12",
      "hash64": "EB63A004C6326908",
      "text": "Je trouve ça dommage, évidemment...\\nMais je comprends et respecte votre décision !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_woman_13",
      "hash64": "EB63A104C6326ABB",
      "text": "Et vous savez... J’adore autant vos cours que\\nles capacités de type Roche ! Merci pour tout !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_19",
      "hash64": "2C24ECA1DF903726",
      "text": "Eh bien... Je crois que cette affaire\\nest désormais classée.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_20",
      "hash64": "2C287BA1DF935FFA",
      "text": "Mais, comment dire... J’étais plutôt nerveuse de\\ndevoir faire toutes ces grandes déclarations ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_21",
      "hash64": "2C287CA1DF9361AD",
      "text": "Et je dois admettre que l’intensité avec laquelle\\ncette élève me regardait m’inquiétait un peu...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_22",
      "hash64": "2C2879A1DF935C94",
      "text": "Enfin, ce n’était qu’une fan curieuse, alors\\ntout est bien qui finit bien.\\c\\nMais si tu n’avais pas été là, je n’aurais sûrement\\npas osé aller lui parler.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 155,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_23",
      "hash64": "2C287AA1DF935E47",
      "text": "À croire que tu es toujours au bon endroit\\nau bon moment. Merci beaucoup ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "kizuna_math_d_24",
      "hash64": "2C2877A1DF93592E",
      "text": "Voilà un petit cadeau pour exprimer ma gratitude.\\nJ’espère que cela te sera utile dans tes aventures.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
